      "evidence": "63 characters on https://engine.com.pk/:\n    \"Engine Official: Western Wear Clothing Store!\n – EngineClothing\"",
      "impact": "Google truncates titles at roughly 60 characters, so the end of this one is replaced with an ellipsis. If the distinguishing words are at the end, searchers never see them.",
